Build a production-ready modern web application UI called:

"Pa-O Typing Tutor"

A professional language-learning typing platform designed to help users learn Pa-O Unicode typing, improve typing speed, accuracy, and preserve the Pa-O language digitally.

The application should feel like a combination of:
- Monkeytype (typing experience)
- TypingClub (learning progression)
- Duolingo (gamification)
- Modern SaaS education dashboard

================================================
DESIGN SYSTEM
================================================

Style:
- Modern educational SaaS
- Clean
- Premium
- Friendly
- Minimal
- High readability
- Suitable for students and teachers

Color Palette:

Primary:
#2563EB (Education Blue)

Secondary:
#22C55E (Learning Green)

Accent:
#F59E0B (Achievement Gold)

Background:
#F8FAFC

Card:
#FFFFFF

Text:
#0F172A

Muted:
#64748B

Error:
#EF4444


Typography:
- Inter
- Noto Sans Myanmar
- Noto Sans Myanmar UI
- Support Pa-O Unicode characters properly

UI Rules:
- Rounded corners 12px-16px
- Soft shadows
- Smooth animations
- Spacious layout
- Responsive design
- Desktop first but mobile friendly


================================================
APPLICATION STRUCTURE
================================================


Create the following pages:

1. Landing Page

2. Learning Dashboard

3. Typing Practice

4. Typing Test

5. Lesson Library

6. Progress Dashboard

7. Leaderboard

8. User Profile

9. Admin Content Management


