Bottom navigation


================================================
IMPORTANT
================================================


The UI must correctly support:

- Pa-O Unicode characters
- Myanmar Unicode fonts
- Long Pa-O sentences
- Language learning environment


The final design should look like a real production educational platform ready for thousands of Pa-O learners.